# Signal — secrets. Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit the filled-in copy.
#
# Signal runs with none of these set: it falls back to RSS plus Hacker News for
# sources and its offline extractive summarizer for the writing. Every key below
# adds something rather than being required.

# --- Summarizer -------------------------------------------------------------
# Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint works. The default points at Groq's free tier;
# change `base_url` and `model` in signal.toml to use OpenAI, OpenRouter,
# Together, or a local Ollama.
GROQ_API_KEY=

# --- Extra source -----------------------------------------------------------
# Adds keyword search across NewsAPI's index on top of your feeds.
NEWS_API_KEY=

# --- Email delivery ---------------------------------------------------------
# For Gmail, SENDER_PASSWORD must be an App Password, not your account password:
# https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
SENDER_EMAIL=
SENDER_PASSWORD=
RECIPIENT_EMAILS=you@example.com

# Non-Gmail SMTP (port 465 switches to implicit TLS automatically)
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.fastmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587

# --- Optional extras --------------------------------------------------------
# Post the digest to Slack or Discord as well as emailing it.
# SIGNAL_WEBHOOK_URL=

# Public URL of the archive site, used for "read on the web" links in emails.
# SIGNAL_SITE_BASE_URL=https://sxnmit.github.io/signal
